<header><p class="enc-kicker">State</p><h1 class="enc-title">Ethiopian Empire</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Ethiopian Empire was the Christian monarchy of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ethiopian-highlands">Ethiopian highlands</a> that lasted from the restoration of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/solomonic-dynasty">Solomonic dynasty</a> in 1270 until the deposition of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/haile-selassie">Haile Selassie</a> in 1974. It survived the Adal invasion in the sixteenth century, defeated <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-adwa">Adwa</a> in 1896 and, after Italian occupation, was restored in 1941.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/ethiopian-empire.jpg" alt="Ethiopian Empire" width="320" height="214" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Oren neu dag · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Ethiopia_(1897%E2%80%931974).svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
